lic","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":38223872,"digest":"sha256:8b638ccfbba14b1d732ab6828ce6a84d2681112de73d24d15f208126a00ca6e8","download_count":59,"created_at":"2026-10-09T12:30:50Z","updated_at":"2026-10-09T12:30:52Z"},{"id":624906172,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSPdiBc4lP0-8","name":"DBX_x64.app.tar.gz","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":42990361,"digest":"sha256:7a5e9bf26af6af145c505332eac8b1d828e1816320bbcdf11dfbf2b2b4e5fbfc","download_count":78,"created_at":"2026-10-09T12:25:30Z","updated_at":"2026-10-09T12:25:33Z"},{"id":624952831,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSPdiBc4lQAX_","name":"latest.json","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/json","state":"uploaded","size":17703,"digest":"sha256:a500dd5ee8f02835c0e2018fed078c51dec5302fac3ee21d37f0f232a1c83fd3","download_count":14785,"created_at":"2026-10-09T12:45:43Z","updated_at":"2026-10-09T12:45:43Z"}],"body":"### 新功能\n\n- 查询结果支持直接导出到其他数据库 (contributed by @eryajf) (PR [#11362](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11362))\n- 结果集批量新增行时显示进度并支持取消，粘贴多行时自动扩展行 (contributed by @caichangqing1120) (PR [#11343](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11343))\n- 支持复制单列多行数据的原始文本 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#11498](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11498))\n- 点击结果集底部的聚合统计值即可复制 (contributed by @Abeautifulsnow) (PR [#11494](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11494))\n- DB2 支持查看估算执行计划 (contributed by @Rendegou) (PR [#11485](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11485))\n- MySQL 建表时支持设置自增起始值 (contributed by @eryajf) (PR [#11476](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11476))\n- OceanBase Oracle 模式对象树显示对象注释并支持按注释搜索 (contributed by @efeire) (PR [#11448](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11448))\n- OceanBase Oracle 模式新增约束只读页 (contributed by @efeire) (PR [#11450](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11450))\n- 数据传输任务保留运行历史记录 (contributed by @0verme) (PR [#11303](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11303))\n- 新增关闭窗口快捷键 Shift+Mod+W (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#11084](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11084))\n\n### 改进\n\n- 连接树支持紧凑行密度设置 (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#11082](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11082))\n- 支持自定义结果集十字光标高亮颜色 (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#11078](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11078))\n- MQ 主题列表支持手动调整列宽并持久化 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#11366](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11366))\n- 数据导入时列名不匹配默认改用按位置映射 (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#11305](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11305))\n- 优化 PostgreSQL 查询结果行处理性能，未配置文本编码的连接不再逐行解码列名\n\n### 修复\n\n- 修复结果集加载全部后仍重复请求已取尽数据的问题 (contributed by @dienaso) (PR [#11341](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11341))\n- 修复结果集无列时底部导出菜单未隐藏的问题 (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#11164](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11164))\n- 修复转置视图排序循环无法回到原始顺序的问题 (contributed by @eryajf) (PR [#11363](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11363))\n- 修复结果集导航未遵循结果标签显示模式设置的问题 (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#11489](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11489))\n- 修复切换编辑器标签页时视口与选区相互串扰的问题 (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#11478](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11478))\n- 修复插入值提示附近无法拖拽选择的问题 (contributed by @eryajf) (PR [#11295](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11295))\n- 修复 SQL 排版格式化未遵循关键字大小写设置的问题 (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#11404](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11404))\n- 修复侧栏搜索未将已置顶表排在最前的问题 (contributed by @HighBigSky) (PR [#11484](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11484))\n- 修复导航定位时数据库与工作区标签页切换不正确的问题 (contributed by @eryajf) (PR [#11298](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11298))\n- 修复表结构编辑器扩展属性列宽不足导致标签显示不完整的问题 (contributed by @peakxy) (PR [#11367](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11367))\n- 修复选项搜索未优先精确与前缀匹配的问题 (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#11304](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11304))\n- 修复复合外键结构比对误报与同步 SQL 生成错误的问题 (contributed by @ordinary-s) (PR [#11297](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11297))\n- 修复图表 y 轴已选列不显示勾选指示的问题 (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#11306](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11306))\n- 修复粘贴表数据量大时被客户端超时中断的问题 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#11385](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11385))\n- 修复备份窗口不记住上次备份目录的问题 (contributed by @HighBigSky) (PR [#11346](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11346))\n- 修复部分 GitLab 实例代码片段下载失败的问题，改用实例 API 下载 (contributed by @caichangqing1120) (PR [#11421](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11421))\n- 修复功能受限的 WebDAV 服务无法云同步的问题，现支持 ZIP 快照方式\n- 修复 MongoDB 命令诊断把 JS 辅助行错误归因到命令的问题 (contributed by @yiqiui) (PR [#11339](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11339))\n- 修复 MCP tools/list 与 resources/list 响应缺少完整结果类型元数据的问题\n- 修复 PostgreSQL / openGauss 原生连接不支持历史文本编码参数导致旧编码数据乱码的问题 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#11482](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11482))\n- 修复 MySQL 脚本重复 DELIMITER 指令导致执行崩溃的问题 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#11473](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11473))\n- 修复 MySQL 视图 CASE/REPLACE 函数格式化无反应的问题 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#11335](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11335))\n- 修复 Oracle 慢字段元数据阻塞自动提交查询的问题 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#11401](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11401))\n- 修复 Oracle 查看执行计划时 PLAN_TABLE 读写不一致的问题 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#11333](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11333))\n- 修复 Oracle 与 OceanBase Oracle 模式 DBLink 与 q 字面量参数扫描的问题 (contributed by @efeire) (PR [#11390](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11390))\n- 修复 Oracle 查询 panic 后连接未释放的问题 (contributed by @ordinary-s) (PR [#11299](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11299))\n- 修复 OceanBase Oracle 模式切换连接后当前 schema 未初始化的问题 (contributed by @efeire) (PR [#11383](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11383))\n- 修复 SAP HANA 漏读 _SYS_BIC 建模视图及视图计数为 0 的问题 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#11434](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11434))\n- 修复 SQL Server 查询已含 TOP 或 OFFSET-FETCH 时分页包装隐式追加排序导致报错的问题 (contributed by @Tong-bit-art) (PR [#11492](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11492))\n- 修复 SQL Server 集合运算与 FOR JSON 查询分页处理遗漏的问题 (contributed by @Tong-bit-art) (PR [#11490](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11490))\n- 修复 SQL Server 旧版兼容驱动不完整返回批次结果和错误的问题 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#11359](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11359))\n- 修复低于 7.4 的 Redis 上含二进制键名或字段名的 hash 查询 TTL 详情失败的问题，现先用安全参数探测 HTTL 支持 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#11381](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11381))\n- 修复 SunDB 对象树未按 schema 加载表导致表数量为 0 的问题 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#11361](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11361))\n\n---\n<!-- dbx-cnb-mirror -->\n> 国内下载：如果 GitHub 下载较慢，可从 [CNB 镜像](https://cnb.cool/dbxio.com/dbx/-/releases/tag/v0.6.38) 下载桌面端安装包，Docker 镜像从 `docker.cnb.cool/dbxio.com/dbx:v0.6.38` 拉取。\n","reactions":{"total_count":4,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"mentions_count":14}
